[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m When the square is folded so that one pair of opposite corners coincide, the fold line will be the diagonal of the square. The diagonal of a square with side length \( s \) is given by \( s\sqrt{2} \). Therefore, the length of the diagonal is:
