[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m We need to find the probability that the game is won before the fourth turn. This means the game can be won on the first, second, or third turn. We will calculate the probability of not winning on the first three turns and then subtract this from 1.
