[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m    So, the expression \(\left(2^2\right)^3\) becomes \(4^3\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 4. Calculate \(4^3\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m    \[
