[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m The perimeter of one of these right triangles is the sum of the lengths of its three sides. The sides are 7 inches, 7 inches, and \( \frac{7\sqrt{2}}{2} \) inches. Therefore, the perimeter \(P\) is:
