[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Thus, the number of inches in the perimeter of one of these triangles is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
