[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 2. Simplify the expression inside the parentheses.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 3. Simplify the entire expression.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m First, substitute \(a = 8\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Next, simplify inside the parentheses. We know that \(8 = 2^3\), so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
