[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[x^2 - 8x + 16 = 11 - 2x.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Rearranging all terms to one side of the equation, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
