[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Now, let's rewrite the inequalities using this form:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[ (x+3)^2 - 8 + (y+3)^2 - 8 \le 0 \implies (x+3)^2 + (y+3)^2 \le 16 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[ (x+3)^2 - 8 - ((y+3)^2 - 8) \le 0 \implies (x+3)^2 \le (y+3)^2 \implies |x+3| \le |y+3| \]
