[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Given that the volume of the sphere is \( \frac{\pi}{6} \) cubic inches, we can set up the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \frac{4}{3} \pi \left( \frac{s}{2} \right)^3 = \frac{\pi}{6}
