[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 1. \(f(x) + f(y) \le 0\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 2. \(f(x) - f(y) \le 0\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m First, let's rewrite the function \(f(x) = x^2 + 6x + 1\). The first condition becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[x^2 + 6x + 1 + y^2 + 6y + 1 \le 0 \implies x^2 + y^2 + 6x + 6y + 2 \le 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Completing the square, we get:
