[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[x^2 + 4x + y^2 - 10y + z^2 + 2z + 5 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m First, we complete the square for the \(x\), \(y\), and \(z\) terms:
