[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m The given equation is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[x^2 + 4x + y^2 - 10y + z^2 + 2z + 5 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m First, we complete the square for the \(x\), \(y\), and \(z\) terms:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[x^2 + 4x \quad \text{becomes} \quad (x+2)^2 - 4,\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[y^2 - 10y \quad \text{becomes} \quad (y-5)^2 - 25,\]
