[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m [response] To solve the expression \(\left(16\sqrt[3]{a^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}\) given that \(a = 8\), we can proceed as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m First, substitute \(a = 8\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Next, simplify inside the cube root:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 8^2 = 64 \quad \text{so} \quad \sqrt[3]{64} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Thus, the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \left(16 \cdot 4\right)^{\frac{1}{3}} = \left(64\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Since \(64 = 4^3\), we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \left(4^3\right)^{\frac{1}{3}} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m Therefore, the value is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[
