[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[(x+2)^2 + (y-5)^2 + (z+1)^2 - 25 = 0,\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m \[(x+2)^2 + (y-5)^2 + (z+1)^2 = 25.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m From this, we can see that the center of the sphere is \((-2, 5, -1)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=42128)[0m 
